{"lineas":[{"speaker":"Ethan","start":0,"end":8.266,"text":"Okay, Sarah, I have been dying to tell you this story all week, because it sounds like a scam and it's actually one of the most famous studies in medicine.","words":[{"w":"Okay,","s":0,"e":0.48},{"w":"Sarah,","s":0.48,"e":1.12},{"w":"I","s":1.12,"e":1.28},{"w":"have","s":1.28,"e":1.44},{"w":"been","s":1.44,"e":1.6},{"w":"dying","s":1.6,"e":1.92},{"w":"to","s":1.92,"e":2},{"w":"tell","s":2,"e":2.24},{"w":"you","s":2.24,"e":2.32},{"w":"this","s":2.32,"e":2.56},{"w":"story","s":2.56,"e":2.88},{"w":"all","s":2.88,"e":3.2},{"w":"week,","s":3.2,"e":3.84},{"w":"because","s":3.84,"e":4.08},{"w":"it","s":4.08,"e":4.24},{"w":"sounds","s":4.24,"e":4.56},{"w":"like","s":4.56,"e":4.72},{"w":"a","s":4.72,"e":4.88},{"w":"scam","s":4.88,"e":5.52},{"w":"and","s":5.52,"e":5.68},{"w":"it's","s":5.68,"e":5.92},{"w":"actually","s":5.92,"e":6.16},{"w":"one","s":6.16,"e":6.4},{"w":"of","s":6.4,"e":6.56},{"w":"the","s":6.56,"e":6.64},{"w":"most","s":6.64,"e":6.88},{"w":"famous","s":6.88,"e":7.2},{"w":"studies","s":7.2,"e":7.52},{"w":"in","s":7.52,"e":7.76},{"w":"medicine.","s":7.76,"e":8.266}]},{"speaker":"Sarah","start":8.566,"end":18.365,"text":"That is a dangerous combination, Ethan. Every time you say 'famous study,' I brace myself for something that got debunked five years later. So go ahead, impress me.","words":[{"w":"That","s":8.566,"e":8.88},{"w":"is","s":8.88,"e":9.04},{"w":"a","s":9.04,"e":9.2},{"w":"dangerous","s":9.2,"e":9.68},{"w":"combination,","s":9.68,"e":10.48},{"w":"Ethan.","s":10.48,"e":11.12},{"w":"Every","s":11.2,"e":11.44},{"w":"time","s":11.44,"e":11.68},{"w":"you","s":11.68,"e":11.84},{"w":"say","s":11.84,"e":12.08},{"w":"'famous","s":12.08,"e":12.558},{"w":"study,'","s":12.558,"e":13.035},{"w":"I","s":13.035,"e":13.275},{"w":"brace","s":13.275,"e":13.595},{"w":"myself","s":13.595,"e":14.075},{"w":"for","s":14.075,"e":14.235},{"w":"something","s":14.235,"e":14.555},{"w":"that","s":14.555,"e":14.875},{"w":"got","s":14.875,"e":15.195},{"w":"debunked","s":15.195,"e":15.675},{"w":"five","s":15.675,"e":15.915},{"w":"years","s":15.915,"e":16.155},{"w":"later.","s":16.155,"e":16.715},{"w":"So","s":16.875,"e":17.035},{"w":"go","s":17.035,"e":17.275},{"w":"ahead,","s":17.275,"e":17.515},{"w":"impress","s":17.515,"e":17.915},{"w":"me.","s":17.915,"e":18.365}]},{"speaker":"Ethan","start":18.665,"end":29.904,"text":"In 2002, a surgeon in Houston took patients with painful arthritic knees, made real incisions, pretended to operate, stitched them up, and sent them home. Fake surgery.","words":[{"w":"In","s":18.665,"e":18.875},{"w":"2002,","s":18.875,"e":19.995},{"w":"a","s":19.995,"e":20.235},{"w":"surgeon","s":20.235,"e":20.555},{"w":"in","s":20.555,"e":20.715},{"w":"Houston","s":20.715,"e":21.115},{"w":"took","s":21.115,"e":21.435},{"w":"patients","s":21.435,"e":21.755},{"w":"with","s":21.755,"e":21.915},{"w":"painful","s":21.915,"e":22.315},{"w":"arthritic","s":22.315,"e":22.875},{"w":"knees,","s":22.875,"e":23.595},{"w":"made","s":23.675,"e":23.995},{"w":"real","s":23.995,"e":24.235},{"w":"incisions,","s":24.235,"e":25.035},{"w":"pretended","s":25.035,"e":25.515},{"w":"to","s":25.515,"e":25.675},{"w":"operate,","s":25.675,"e":26.395},{"w":"stitched","s":26.395,"e":26.875},{"w":"them","s":26.875,"e":26.955},{"w":"up,","s":26.955,"e":27.435},{"w":"and","s":27.435,"e":27.515},{"w":"sent","s":27.515,"e":27.755},{"w":"them","s":27.755,"e":27.995},{"w":"home.","s":27.995,"e":28.155},{"w":"Fake","s":28.79,"e":29.27},{"w":"surgery.","s":29.27,"e":29.904}]},{"speaker":"Sarah","start":30.204,"end":40.235,"text":"Hold on, hold on. He cut people open, did absolutely nothing inside, and closed them? I'm sorry, but where I come from that's called fraud, not medicine.","words":[{"w":"Hold","s":30.204,"e":30.55},{"w":"on,","s":30.55,"e":31.03},{"w":"hold","s":31.03,"e":31.35},{"w":"on.","s":31.35,"e":31.91},{"w":"He","s":31.91,"e":32.23},{"w":"cut","s":32.23,"e":32.55},{"w":"people","s":32.55,"e":32.87},{"w":"open,","s":32.87,"e":33.35},{"w":"did","s":33.35,"e":33.59},{"w":"absolutely","s":33.59,"e":34.23},{"w":"nothing","s":34.23,"e":34.55},{"w":"inside,","s":34.55,"e":35.03},{"w":"and","s":35.03,"e":35.35},{"w":"closed","s":35.35,"e":35.67},{"w":"them?","s":35.67,"e":36.23},{"w":"I'm","s":36.55,"e":36.79},{"w":"sorry,","s":36.79,"e":37.27},{"w":"but","s":37.27,"e":37.43},{"w":"where","s":37.43,"e":37.67},{"w":"I","s":37.67,"e":37.83},{"w":"come","s":37.83,"e":37.99},{"w":"from","s":37.99,"e":38.15},{"w":"that's","s":38.15,"e":38.47},{"w":"called","s":38.47,"e":38.71},{"w":"fraud,","s":38.71,"e":39.35},{"w":"not","s":39.35,"e":39.51},{"w":"medicine.","s":39.51,"e":40.23}]},{"speaker":"Ethan","start":40.535,"end":49.823,"text":"That's the twist — it was an official trial, published in the New England Journal of Medicine. A hundred and eighty patients agreed, knowing they might get the fake version.","words":[{"w":"That's","s":40.535,"e":40.87},{"w":"the","s":40.87,"e":40.95},{"w":"twist","s":40.95,"e":41.27},{"w":"—","s":41.27,"e":41.595},{"w":"it","s":41.595,"e":41.915},{"w":"was","s":41.915,"e":41.995},{"w":"an","s":41.995,"e":42.235},{"w":"official","s":42.235,"e":42.635},{"w":"trial,","s":42.635,"e":43.275},{"w":"published","s":43.355,"e":43.755},{"w":"in","s":43.755,"e":43.915},{"w":"the","s":43.915,"e":43.995},{"w":"New","s":43.995,"e":44.155},{"w":"England","s":44.155,"e":44.475},{"w":"Journal","s":44.475,"e":44.795},{"w":"of","s":44.795,"e":44.955},{"w":"Medicine.","s":44.955,"e":45.595},{"w":"A","s":45.595,"e":46.235},{"w":"hundred","s":46.235,"e":46.395},{"w":"and","s":46.395,"e":46.555},{"w":"eighty","s":46.555,"e":46.795},{"w":"patients","s":46.795,"e":47.195},{"w":"agreed,","s":47.195,"e":47.915},{"w":"knowing","s":47.995,"e":48.315},{"w":"they","s":48.315,"e":48.475},{"w":"might","s":48.475,"e":48.715},{"w":"get","s":48.715,"e":48.875},{"w":"the","s":48.875,"e":49.035},{"w":"fake","s":49.035,"e":49.275},{"w":"version.","s":49.275,"e":49.82